  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.110" end="00:07.830" ttm:agent="v1">La, la, la-la-la-la</p>
      <p begin="00:07.830" end="00:11.880" ttm:agent="v1">Hitomi no oku kasanaru eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:11.880" end="00:16.060" ttm:agent="v1">Koyoi futari wo terasu moon</p>
      <p begin="00:16.060" end="00:20.120" ttm:agent="v1">Nine to five dreaming, kore ja marude koi ne</p>
      <p begin="00:20.120" end="00:25.230" ttm:agent="v1">But the odds were high, yumemitai kibun?</p>
      <p begin="00:25.230" end="00:29.380" ttm:agent="v1">Matteru dake ja nanimo hajiman’nai</p>
      <p begin="00:29.380" end="00:31.900" ttm:agent="v1">I am precious, ooh, but, jibun no koe de step up, boom</p>
      <p begin="00:31.900" end="00:36.100" ttm:agent="v1">Tokei no hari ga futari made tick-tock</p>
      <p begin="00:36.100" end="00:41.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Mahou no you ni love in blooming (la-la-la-la)</p>
      <p begin="00:41.340" end="00:46.060" ttm:agent="v1">Kidzukeba nukedasenai yo, I'm good to go</p>
      <p begin="00:46.060" end="00:49.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Go) yeah (yeah), tomedonaku muchuu</p>
      <p begin="00:49.060" end="00:53.700" ttm:agent="v1">You're my crush, hajikeru bubble</p>
      <p begin="00:53.700" end="00:58.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">We can't stop, hikareau hodo (oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:58.220" end="01:01.790" ttm:agent="v1">Crush, takanaru kodou</p>
      <p begin="01:01.790" end="01:05.480" ttm:agent="v1">We can't stop, kimi to nara fallin' in love</p>
      <p begin="01:05.480" end="01:09.470" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa-whoa, oh-oh, woah-whoa, oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="01:09.470" end="01:13.530" ttm:agent="v1">Yume no naka odoritai sugar spot</p>
      <p begin="01:13.530" end="01:16.740" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa-whoa, oh-oh, oh-woah-whoa</p>
      <p begin="01:16.740" end="01:22.340" ttm:agent="v1">Kowareru hodo crush on you, kimi to nara fallin' in</p>
      <p begin="01:22.340" end="01:26.270" ttm:agent="v1">Aseru kimochi kotae wa mada, baby? Love is danger</p>
      <p begin="01:26.270" end="01:30.450" ttm:agent="v1">Shinchou ni naru hodo ni every piece of me, my pleasure</p>
      <p begin="01:30.450" end="01:33.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Honey (honey) like roses (roses) mau you ni sasou</p>
      <p begin="01:33.990" end="01:38.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yureru omoi like a butterfly (butterfly), tokete’ku moonlight</p>
      <p begin="01:38.790" end="01:42.840" ttm:agent="v1">Matteru nante mou iwasenaide</p>
      <p begin="01:42.840" end="01:45.860" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, you're my precious one, jibun no koe de step up, boom</p>
      <p begin="01:45.860" end="01:50.000" ttm:agent="v1">Tokei no hari ga futari made tick-tock</p>
      <p begin="01:50.000" end="01:55.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Mahou no you ni love in blooming (la-la-la-la)</p>
      <p begin="01:55.180" end="01:59.790" ttm:agent="v1">Kidzukeba nukedasenai yo, I'm good to go</p>
      <p begin="01:59.790" end="02:02.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Go) yeah (yeah), tomedonaku muchuu</p>
      <p begin="02:02.920" end="02:07.580" ttm:agent="v1">You're my crush, hajikeru bubble</p>
      <p begin="02:07.580" end="02:12.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">We can't stop, hikareau hodo (oh)</p>
      <p begin="02:12.010" end="02:15.650" ttm:agent="v1">Crush, takanaru kodou</p>
      <p begin="02:15.650" end="02:19.440" ttm:agent="v1">We can't stop, kimi to nara fallin' in love</p>
      <p begin="02:19.440" end="02:23.360" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa-whoa, oh-oh, woah-whoa, oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="02:23.360" end="02:27.480" ttm:agent="v1">Yume no naka odoritai sugar spot</p>
      <p begin="02:27.480" end="02:30.770" ttm:agent="v1">Whoa-whoa, oh-oh, oh-woah-whoa</p>
      <p begin="02:30.770" end="02:36.640" ttm:agent="v1">Kowareru hodo crush on you, kimi to nara fallin' in</p>
      <p begin="02:36.640" end="02:40.780" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, hey, DIVE, kore kara doko iku?</p>
      <p begin="02:40.780" end="02:44.580" ttm:agent="v1">I think I'm finally done with you</p>
      <p begin="02:44.580" end="02:47.590" ttm:agent="v1">Kowareru hodo love crush</p>
      <p begin="02:47.590" end="02:51.030" ttm:agent="v1">Tomedonaku muchuu</p>
      <p begin="02:51.030" end="02:56.740" ttm:agent="v1">You're my crush, hajikeru bubble</p>
      <p begin="02:56.740" end="03:01.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">We can't stop, hikareau hodo (oh)</p>
      <p begin="03:01.380" end="03:04.860" ttm:agent="v1">Crush, takanaru kodou</p>
      <p begin="03:04.860" end="03:09.320" ttm:agent="v1">We can't stop, kimi to nara fallin' in love</p>
      <p begin="03:09.320" end="03:13.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Crush on you, mou matenai blue moon (ah, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="03:13.280" end="03:17.820" ttm:agent="v1">I'm finally feeling like I got my freedom</p>
      <p begin="03:17.820" end="03:21.870" ttm:agent="v1">Crush on you, kimi mo muchuu, yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="03:21.870" end="03:27.210" ttm:agent="v1">Love crush, you're my crush</p>
      <p begin="03:27.210" end="03:31.210" ttm:agent="v1"/>
